# Motion tour (owner, 2026-11-17: the frame never leaves; the transition starts at the tap). Run in demo mode by the lead, in the format of
# fixtures/tours/files-open.steps: `expect <id>` the tree has a view with that testId, `absent <id>` it has none, `shot <name>` a screenshot.
# `clock +N real` runs real time so a transition is in flight at the shot; the shots named -mid are mid-transition (about 80 ms after the tap,
# inside the 160 to 220 ms slide), the shots named -after are at rest. Read each pair together: in -mid the tab row, the title and "New message"
# are present and the content is part way (old rows sliding and dimming, or the skeleton); in -after only the new content is shown.
# What only a device can prove: that the slide is smooth (the shots are single frames), that Reduce Motion gives a cross-fade only (turn it on in
# Settings > Accessibility and run the Mail part again), and that tapping a tab twice quickly leaves the second tab shown.
tap bar-pages
clock +600 real
tap pile-places
clock +600 real
tap place-mail
clock +1200 real
clock data
tree
expect page-title
expect mail-folder-inbox
expect mail-folder-drafts
expect mail-folder-sent
expect mail-folder-quarantine
absent mail-loading
shot motion-mail-inbox-after
# Inbox to Sent: the tab underline moves at the tap, the inbox rows leave to the left, Sent comes in from the right.
tap mail-folder-sent
clock +80 real
tree
expect mail-folder-quarantine
expect page-title
absent mail-loading
shot motion-mail-sent-mid
clock +900 real
shot motion-mail-sent-after
# Sent to Quarantine, and straight back: the frame is there in every shot, the second tap wins.
tap mail-folder-quarantine
clock +80 real
expect mail-folder-inbox
shot motion-mail-quarantine-mid
tap mail-folder-drafts
clock +80 real
shot motion-mail-drafts-mid
clock +900 real
tree
expect mail-folder-drafts
absent mail-loading
shot motion-mail-drafts-after
# A slow answer: the frame stays and a skeleton (no words) holds the place; nothing says Loading.
tap mail-demo-loading
clock +300 real
tree
expect mail-folder-inbox
expect mail-skeleton
absent mail-loading
shot motion-mail-slow
# Places from the tray: the deck springs to the place; the tray opens and closes with the rise.
tap bar-pages
clock +80 real
shot motion-tray-opening-mid
clock +600 real
tap pile-places
clock +600 real
tap place-textures
clock +100 real
shot motion-place-textures-mid
clock +900 real
shot motion-place-textures-after
tap bar-pages
clock +600 real
tap pile-places
clock +600 real
tap place-files
clock +100 real
shot motion-place-files-mid
clock +900 real
tree
absent files-loading
shot motion-place-files-after
# The Autoradio page: the on-air entry changes (Next), Up next and Heard rows move, "Built on" expands.
tap bar-pages
clock +600 real
tap pile-places
clock +600 real
tap place-radio
clock +1200 real
tap radio-play
clock +400 real
tap radio-next
clock +100 real
shot motion-radio-entry-mid
clock +800 real
shot motion-radio-entry-after
